This sysroot has no libatomic: clang lowers wasm64's atomic operations
inline and ships no separate runtime library for them, so the -latomic the
linux+clang condition adds is unresolvable -- wasm-ld: error: unable to find
library -latomic.

--- a/node.gyp
+++ b/node.gyp
@@ -544,9 +544,6 @@
           '-Wl,-bnoerrmsg',
         ],
       }],
-      ['OS=="linux" and clang==1', {
-        'libraries': ['-latomic'],
-      }],
     ],
   },
 
